    <statement><p>Find an equation for the contour of
<m>f(x, y) = 2 x^2 y + 6 x + 15</m> that goes through the point
<m>(4, 2)</m>.</p>
<p>Equation: <fillin characters="55" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2yx^{2}+6x+15 = 103</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>f(4, 2) = 2\cdot 4^2\cdot 2 + 6 \cdot 4 + 15 =  103</m>,
an equation for the contour is
<me>2 x^2 y + 6 x + 15 = 103.</me>



</solution>
